    "legal_toc_section_gYznx3": {
      "type": "legal-toc-section",
      "blocks": {
        "content_section_GLa7AN": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "settings": {
            "nav_label": "Our commitment",
            "title": "1. Our commitment to trust and transparency",
            "lead": "<p>Your rights come from the law, not from our goodwill. This page sets them out in one place, alongside the promises Karmicare adds on top.</p>",
            "content": "<p>At KARMICARE, we believe in radical transparency, both in the biological formulations we craft and in the commercial relationships we build with our community. This charter summarises your statutory rights under:</p><ul><li>The Belgian Code of Economic Law (WER/CDE), notably Book VI on market practices and consumer protection;</li><li>The EU Consumer Rights Directive (2011/83/EU);</li><li>The EU Omnibus Directive (2019/2161) on modernised consumer protection rules;</li><li>The EU Sale of Goods Directive (2019/771), transposed into Belgian law by the Law of 20 March 2022;</li><li>The EU Cosmetics Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009.</li></ul><p>Whether you order a single Duo or keep a plan running, your legal rights are fully protected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_section_g6nYeY": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "settings": {
            "nav_label": "Safety and standards",
            "title": "2. Safety and standards",
            "lead": "<p>Awake and Asleep are notified EU cosmetics, made under Good Manufacturing Practice and assessed by a qualified safety assessor.</p>",
            "content": "<p>All KARMICARE products, including Awake Morning Toothpaste, Asleep Evening Toothpaste, Charcoal Floss and the Toothbrushes, are:</p><ul><li>Formulated and manufactured in accordance with European Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP / ISO 22716);</li><li>Registered and notified on the European Cosmetic Product Notification Portal (CPNP) in compliance with Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009;</li><li>Subject to a Cosmetic Product Safety Report (CPSR) signed by a qualified European safety assessor;</li><li>100% free of SLS, parabens, artificial dyes, endocrine disruptors and controversial abrasives.</li></ul><p>Regulatory classification: KARMICARE oral care products are cosmetics intended for daily oral hygiene, biorhythmic remineralisation and enamel support. They are not medicinal products or medical devices and do not claim to diagnose, treat or cure medical conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_section_iDEfUH": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "settings": {
            "nav_label": "Refunds and withdrawal",
            "title": "3. Refunds, withdrawal and the 60-day guarantee",
            "lead": "<p>Changed your mind about a one-time order? You have 14 days. On the 60-Day plan or the Karmicare Year, you have 60 days to live the ritual and still get a full refund.</p>",
            "content": "<p><strong>3.1 Refund timelines by purchase type</strong></p><p><strong>One-time orders (Try once): your legal right</strong></p><ul><li>You have a statutory right of withdrawal of 14 calendar days from the date of physical delivery (Article VI.47 of the Belgian Code of Economic Law).</li><li>If you withdraw within this period, we reimburse all payments received from you, including standard delivery charges, within 14 calendar days of receiving the returned unopened goods or proof of return.</li><li>Refunds are issued via the same payment method you used for the purchase.</li></ul><p><strong>60-Day plan and Karmicare Year: Karmicare promise</strong></p><ul><li>KARMICARE gives you an extended commercial 60-calendar-day satisfaction guarantee.</li><li>Building a biorhythmic ritual takes consistent daily practice, so you have 60 calendar days from delivery to experience and evaluate Awake and Asleep.</li><li>Not completely satisfied? Email <a href=\"mailto:care@karmicare.com\" target=\"_blank\">care@karmicare.com</a> within 60 calendar days of delivery and we refund 100% of your plan order to your original payment method.</li></ul><p><strong>3.2 Packaging notice: airless pump and first-use priming</strong></p><ul><li>Hermetic airless protection. Our formulas are housed in hygienic airless pump dispensers that shield the active formulation from air, oxidation and microbial contamination without relying on harsh preservatives.</li><li>Unprimed factory state. Our airless bottles are not pre-pumped. When you unbox them, the internal vacuum chamber is sealed and completely dry.</li><li>First-use priming (3 to 10 pumps). On first use, press the pump head firmly 3 to 10 times to activate the piston, clear the air pocket and draw the formula into the nozzle.</li></ul><p><strong>Hygiene seal exemption</strong> (Art. VI.53, 5° WER / Art. 16(e) Directive 2011/83/EU)</p><ul><li>Sealed goods that are not suitable for return for health protection or hygiene reasons, and that were unsealed after delivery, are exempt from the statutory right of withdrawal.</li><li>For one-time orders, an unprimed bottle with intact packaging can be returned within 14 calendar days. Once primed, the bottle is unsealed and opened for intimate personal use, which ends the statutory right of return for one-time orders.</li><li>On the 60-Day plan and the Karmicare Year, the 60-day satisfaction guarantee (section 3.1) still applies after priming.</li></ul><p><strong>3.3 How to request a refund or return</strong></p><p>1. Email <a href=\"mailto:care@karmicare.com\" target=\"_blank\">care@karmicare.com</a> with your order number and plan type (one-time order, 60-Day plan or Karmicare Year).<br/>2. For returns of unopened one-time orders, we send you a return authorisation and the warehouse address: KARMICA BV, Returns Department, Vizierstraat 28, 8000 Bruges, Belgium.<br/>3. Return shipping costs for one-time orders are paid by you, unless the item arrived damaged or defective.<br/>4. All refunds are issued within 14 calendar days via the same payment method you used at checkout. We never replace a refund with a store voucher unless you explicitly ask for one.</p>"
          }
        },
